<h2 id="sec-research-summary" class="section-title">
  <span data-language="en" lang="en">🧭 Research Summary</span>
  <span data-language="zh" lang="zh-CN">🧭 研究总结</span>
</h2>
<div class="clearfix research-summary">
  <div data-language="en" lang="en">
    <p>At <strong>PALM@SEU</strong>, advised by Prof. <a href="https://cs.seu.edu.cn/hongsongwang/main.htm">Hongsong Wang</a>, I study motion alignment: <a href="{{ '/projects/SoPo/index.html' | relative_url }}">SoPo</a> (NeurIPS 2025) addresses scarce preference pairs through semi-online optimization. To align pretrained generators without fine-tuning, <a href="https://wengwanjiang.github.io/ReAlign-page/">ReAlign</a> (AAAI 2026) guides sampling with learned step-aware rewards. For efficient fine-tuning, <a href="{{ '/projects/EasyTune/index.html' | relative_url }}">EasyTune</a> (ICLR 2026) improves alignment with substantially less memory. Building on this, <a href="{{ '/projects/MotionRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">MotionRFT</a> (IEEE TPAMI 2026) extends alignment across motion representations, improving HY Motion’s FID by 23.3%.</p>
    <p>At <strong>Tencent YouTu</strong>, I addressed underexplored barriers to deploying image-generation post-training: visual hallucinations with <a href="{{ '/projects/ConsistentRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">DPGO</a>, and diversity collapse with <a href="{{ '/projects/PEC/index.html' | relative_url }}">PEC</a> (NeurIPS 2026, <strong>Spotlight</strong>). At <strong>Tencent HY</strong>, I extend this work toward reliable spatial-generation post-training, collaborating with Prof. <a href="https://faculty.ucmerced.edu/mhyang/">Ming-Hsuan Yang</a> as a remote visiting student at <strong>UC Merced</strong>. Our <a href="{{ '/projects/SpatialReward/index.html' | relative_url }}">SpatialCritic</a> addresses unreliable spatial rewards and ineffective learning progression, achieving 95.08% verification accuracy on SpaRW-Eval.</p>
    <p>My earlier work at <strong>SZU</strong>, mentored by Prof. <a href="https://csse.szu.edu.cn/pages/user/index?id=953">Can Gao</a>, focused on anomaly detection (AD), including multi-scale outlier detection with <a href="{{ '/Publications/' | relative_url }}#tanGB">MGBOD</a> (IEEE TKDE 2025). This line later extended to video anomaly detection with <a href="{{ '/projects/FG-Diff/index.html' | relative_url }}">FG-Diff</a> (IEEE TIP 2026), outperforming compared state-of-the-art methods on five datasets.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-language="zh" lang="zh-CN">
    <p>在 <strong>PALM@SEU</strong>，我在 <a href="https://cs.seu.edu.cn/hongsongwang/main.htm">Hongsong Wang（王洪松）</a>教授指导下研究动作生成对齐：<a href="{{ '/projects/SoPo/index.html' | relative_url }}">SoPo</a>（NeurIPS 2025）以半在线优化应对偏好对稀缺。为在不微调预训练生成模型的情况下实现对齐，<a href="https://wengwanjiang.github.io/ReAlign-page/">ReAlign</a>（AAAI 2026）以学习得到的步感知奖励引导采样。为提高微调效率，<a href="{{ '/projects/EasyTune/index.html' | relative_url }}">EasyTune</a>（ICLR 2026）在提升对齐效果的同时大幅降低显存开销。在此基础上，<a href="{{ '/projects/MotionRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">MotionRFT</a>（IEEE TPAMI 2026）将对齐拓展至不同动作表示，使 HY Motion 的 FID 改善 23.3%。</p>
    <p>在 <strong>Tencent YouTu</strong>，我关注图像生成后训练中较少受到关注的落地障碍：<a href="{{ '/projects/ConsistentRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">DPGO</a> 减少视觉幻觉，<a href="{{ '/projects/PEC/index.html' | relative_url }}">PEC</a>（NeurIPS 2026，<strong>Spotlight</strong>）缓解多样性崩溃。在 <strong>Tencent HY</strong>，我进一步探索可靠的空间生成后训练，并以远程访问学生身份与 <strong>UC Merced</strong> 的 <a href="https://faculty.ucmerced.edu/mhyang/">Ming-Hsuan Yang</a> 教授合作。我们提出的 <a href="{{ '/projects/SpatialReward/index.html' | relative_url }}">SpatialCritic</a> 解决空间奖励不可靠与学习进程低效的问题，在 SpaRW-Eval 上实现 95.08% 的验证准确率。</p>
    <p>早期在 <strong>SZU</strong>，我在 <a href="https://csse.szu.edu.cn/pages/user/index?id=953">Can Gao</a> 教授指导下研究异常检测（AD），包括 <a href="{{ '/Publications/' | relative_url }}#tanGB">MGBOD</a>（IEEE TKDE 2025）的多尺度离群点检测。这条研究线后来延伸至 <a href="{{ '/projects/FG-Diff/index.html' | relative_url }}">FG-Diff</a>（IEEE TIP 2026）的视频异常检测，在五个数据集上超过所比较的先进方法。</p>
  </div>
</div>
